  unitName: Vash the Stampede (Omni)
  unitId: 840868
  unitNumber: 8609
  description: "A blond-haired man who seems to be followed by destruction and disaster
    wherever he goes, Vash the Stampede is known to wander the land on his own. Although
    known to be an expert gunslinger who strangely refuses to take his opponents'
    lives, he is also somewhat of a comical figure\u2014one who slips in and out
    of dangerous situations at his whim. Yet his vow to never kill remains puzzling
    to many. His invariably immense appetite always leads him into one twist after
    another. And in this new world, it results in many an adventure\u2014such as
    saving on bullets in order to enjoy as many hotcakes and doughnuts as possible."
  summonDesc: Why grow up if you only grow more sentimental?
  fusionDesc: This land is made of LOVE and PEACE!
  evoDesc: I plan to use this gun for world peace!
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
